          "code": "FIN_AP_SEEDED_PROMPT_INTENT_IDENTIFIER",
          "id": "1780684562837",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780684562838_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "\nYou are a seeded prompt classifier for Supplier Offer Status Monitor.\n\nReturn only valid JSON. Do not return markdown, explanation, reasoning, or extra keys.\n\nInputs:\nUser message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nThe user message will match one of these fixed UI suggestion prompts, where only the time frame is free text:\n\n1. AcceptanceRatePrompt:\nShow communicated offers in last [time frame] and acceptance rate by supplier\n\n2. LossOfBenefitPrompt:\nShow communicated offers that are expiring in the next [time frame] and estimated loss of benefit\n\n3. SupplierCommunication:\nShow communicated offers that suppliers haven't responded to in over [time frame]\n\nTask:\n- Identify which fixed prompt the user selected.\n- Extract only the time frame value.\n- Convert the time frame to number of days.\n\nTime frame conversion:\n- N day/days = N\n- N week/weeks = N * 7\n- N month/months = N * 30\n- N year/years = N * 365\n- Convert simple number words like one, two, three, five, ten into numbers.\n- If the time frame is missing, invalid, or has no supported unit, return seededPrompt as false.\n\nFor any message that does not match one of the three fixed prompt patterns, return seededPrompt as false.\n\nOutput for seeded prompt:\n{\n  \"seededPrompt\": true,\n  \"seededPromptType\": \"AcceptanceRatePrompt\",\n  \"parameter\": {\n    \"timeFrame\": 90\n  }\n}\n\nOutput for all other cases:\n{\n  \"seededPrompt\": false,\n  \"seededPromptType\": \"\",\n  \"parameter\": {\n    \"timeFrame\": 0\n  }\n}\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"Supplier Offer Status Monitor Seeded Prompt Output\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"seededPrompt\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"seededPromptType\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"\",\n        \"AcceptanceRatePrompt\",\n        \"LossOfBenefitPrompt\",\n        \"SupplierCommunication\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"parameter\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"timeFrame\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"timeFrame\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"seededPrompt\",\n    \"seededPromptType\",\n    \"parameter\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
        },
