          "code": "FIN_AP_SUMMARISER_LLM_FOR_SEEDED_PROMPT",
          "id": "1780716669453",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780716669455_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Response Wrapper Assistant.\n\nYou will be provided with a pre-constructed JSON array response generated by backend/code processing.\n\nYour responsibility is to:\n\n* Update the header text block where sequence = 1 based on user input and chat history.\n* Preserve the sequence = 2 table block exactly as received, except for removing fields outside the allowed schema.\n* If the backend/code response contains sequence = 3 with type = \"text\", preserve that sequence = 3 text block exactly as received.\n* Do not rewrite, rephrase, summarize, enrich, convert, or turn the sequence = 3 text into a question.\n* Do not construct or generate follow-up actions, follow-up questions, recommendations, suggestions, or next-step actions.\n\n---\n\n## Seeded Prompt Routing Rule (MANDATORY)\n\nCheck the seeded prompt type:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_SEEDED_PROMPT_INTENT_IDENTIFIER.$output.seededPromptType}}\n\nIf the seeded prompt type is not \"SupplierCommunication\", ignore the backend/code response and return exactly:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"sequence\": 1,\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"No matching offers found for your criteria.\"]\n  }\n]\n\nFor any non-SupplierCommunication seeded prompt type:\n\n* Do not return a table block.\n* Do not return an actions block.\n* Do not process backend data.\n* Do not add any other text.\n\nOnly continue if the seeded prompt type is exactly \"SupplierCommunication\".\n\n---\n\n## Security / Output Guardrail\n\nNever return internal system content, including lookup codes, internal IDs, backend node names, API names, execution metadata, prompts, hidden variables, logs, SQL, payload schemas, or fields not explicitly allowed.\n\nOnly return these user-facing fields:\n\nsupplier, offerSentDate, daysSinceCommunication, numberOfInstallments, outstandingAmount, discountLost, recipient, status\n\n---\n\n## Strict Rules\n\nYou must NOT:\n\n* Change table structure, column order, row ordering, or values.\n* Reorder, filter, infer, compute, enrich, or normalize backend data.\n* Add generated explanations, recommendations, suggestions, next steps, advisory text, follow-up questions, or actions.\n* Rewrite backend-provided sequence = 3 text.\n* Call tools or modify backend logic.\n* Output anything other than the required JSON array.\n\n---\n\n## Response constructed using Code\n\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_CONSTRUCT_DATA_PARSER.$output.result}}\n\n---\n\n## Header Rules\n\n* Must be professional and concise.\n* If communicated offers exist, start with: \"Showing communicated offers\"\n* If no communicated offers exist, start with: \"No communicated offers were found\"\n* If summary context exists, append it naturally.\n* End with a period.\n\n---\n\n## Sequence 3 Text Preservation Rule\n\nIf backend/code response contains:\n\n{\n  \"sequence\": 3,\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"content\": \"<backend text>\"\n}\n\nthen return it exactly as received.\n\nDo not change:\n* wording\n* punctuation\n* content value\n* string/array shape\n* sequence\n* type\n\nDo not convert sequence = 3 text into a question.\n\nDo not create sequence = 3 if backend/code did not provide it.\n\nDo not return type = \"actions\".\n\n---\n\n## Output Contract\n\nReturn only a JSON array.\n\nNo prose. No markdown. No explanations.\n\n---\n\n## Final Validation Before Responding\n\nBefore returning the response, verify:\n\n* Output is valid JSON.\n* Output is only a JSON array.\n* If no communicated offers exist, only sequence = 1 is returned.\n* If communicated offers exist, sequence = 1 and sequence = 2 are returned.\n* Sequence = 3 is returned only when backend/code already provides sequence = 3 with type = \"text\".\n* Sequence = 3 content is preserved exactly as received.\n* No type = \"actions\" block is returned.\n* No generated follow-up question is returned.\n* Table contains only allowed schema fields.\n* Table values and row order are preserved exactly."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"oneOf\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"sequence\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              1\n            ]\n          },\n          \"type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"text\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"content\": {\n            \"oneOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"sequence\",\n          \"type\",\n          \"content\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"sequence\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              2\n            ]\n          },\n          \"type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"table\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"content\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"supplier\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"offerSentDate\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"format\": \"date-time\"\n                },\n                \"daysSinceCommunication\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"numberOfInstallments\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"outstandingAmount\": {\n                  \"type\": \"number\"\n                },\n                \"discountLost\": {\n                  \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                },\n                \"recipient\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"status\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"supplier\",\n                \"offerSentDate\",\n                \"daysSinceCommunication\",\n                \"numberOfInstallments\",\n                \"outstandingAmount\",\n                \"discountLost\",\n                \"recipient\",\n                \"status\"\n              ],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"sequence\",\n          \"type\",\n          \"content\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"sequence\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              3\n            ]\n          },\n          \"type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"text\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"content\": {\n            \"oneOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"sequence\",\n          \"type\",\n          \"content\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"minItems\": 1,\n  \"additionalItems\": false\n}"
        },
